<title>POLAND: Beton Stal sells conv bonds.</title>
<headline>Beton Stal sells conv bonds.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish construction company Beton Stal SA has sold 20 million zlotys worth of convertible bonds, the firm said in a statement on Tuesday.</p>
<p>It said earlier that the 200 five-year bonds, worth 100,000 zlotys each, will be offered in exchange for up to two million new shares in the firm.</p>
<p>The statement provided no further details.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
